id: magical-weather
name: Magical Weather
advancement: true
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 5
anyWeather: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Weather Summoning makes any Battle Weather.
text: >
  Magical Weather: You are able to materialize environmental effects that aren’t already present.
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 5
  –Effect: You may create any type of Battle Weather through the effects of Weather Summoning.
